  "content": "<p>將所有不死圖騰都變成《傳送門2》中的 Wheatley。</p>\n<p>你也可以為圖騰重新命名，使其變成其他核心（太空核心、事實核心與冒險核心）。</p>\n<p>材質還是動畫的！他會眨眼並四處張望。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AVusjvaW/images/51adf0a2f7f7ef108476ddbe0ef1a23a6e6a1c93.png\" alt=\"他的外觀\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LeeT64z3WYw\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9ZrFM1aC3bg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3131\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2a4883838950998d67143440012948c2410ff03.png\" alt=\"聯盟行銷連結\"></a></p>",
